OL,3,GNEWSAWoman pedestrian seriously injured
OL,4,Aby car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has been seriously injured
OL,7,Fafter being hit by a car in Hull.
OL,9,FThe 63-year-old pedestrian was crossing
OL,10,FCounty Road South near the junction
OL,11,Fwith Dayton Road at about 18:50 BST on
OL,12,FTuesday when the incident happened,
OL,13,FHumberside Police said.
OL,15,FShe was taken to hospital "after
OL,16,Fsustaining a serious hip injury", the
OL,17,Fforce added.
OL,19,FA police spokesperson said: "The driver
OL,20,Fremained at the scene to await
OL,21,Femergency services and is assisting
OL,22,Fwith our enquiries at this time".
